@Error
ษอออออออออออออออออออ Error อออออออออออออออออออออป
บ             A fatal error ocurred             บÛÛ
บ                 Error message                 บÛÛ
บ                                               บÛÛ
บ     [Retry]   [Fail]   [Ignore]   [Abort]     บÛÛ
ศอออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออผÛÛ
  ÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛÛ

  A fatal error ocurred while executing program,
acompaining this message you will see a sort description
about the error produced:

  þ Disk is write protected
    Disk is protected against write.
    Unprotect it and choose retry.
  þ Unknown unit
    You have selected a drive not recogniced.
    Choose ignore and then retry the operation with a
    correct drive
  þ Drive is not ready
    Drive is not ready to use.
    Insert a disk, close the door and choose retry.
  þ Unknown command
    You have performed an operation not allowed.
    Choose ignore and continue working normally, if this
    error occurs again choose abort.
  þ Data error (Bad CRC)
    You have loaded data from a bad or damaged media.
    Choose retry one time; if the error appears again then
    choose abort.
  þ Bad request structure length
    You have requested one operation that have provoqued
    the device not to work correctly.
    Choose abort.
  þ Seek error
    You have acced your data, and the device seems not to
    get the correct information.
    Choose retry one time; if the error appears again then
    choose abort.
  þ Unkown media type
    You have performed in a drive that is not recogniced
    for the system.
    Choose ignore and continue working normally, if this
    error occurs again choose abort.
  þ Sector not found
    You have loaded or saved data from/to a bad, damaged,
    or unformated media.
    Choose retry one time; if the error appears again then
    choose abort.
  þ Printer is out of paper
    You try to print to a printer withou paper.
    Put paper in it and then choose retry.
  þ Write fault
    You have provoqued a write fault in a device.
    Choose abort.
  þ Read fault
    You have provoqued a read fault in a device.
    Choose abort.
  þ General failure
    A general error without a more concrete description
    happened.

  Possible actions are:

  þ Retry
    Retry the operation that has caused the error; and
    execute it again.
  þ Fail
    Fail current operation; and skip all the program code
    that causes the error.
  þ Ignore
    Ignore the operation that has caused the error; and
    execute the rest.
  þ Abort
    Abort current process; and stop the execution
    inmediately.
@

