  You can tag or untag files using SPACE or INS, move
across the files using Up, Down, PgUp, PgDw, Org, End, and
accept selecction or change directory/drive pressing ENTER;
using F-2 you will be asked by a mask, then all the files
that complain the mask will be taged.

  If no files have been selected using SPACE or INS then
the file pointed by the selection bar when you pressed
ENTER will be tagged automatically.

  By selecting or clicking a directory or a drive, you will
go to it.
